# ============================================================
# UERANSIM — this is its own separate git clone of the upstream
# https://github.com/aligungr/UERANSIM project (confirmed: it has its
# own .git with that remote), not part of this project's source. Without
# this line, `git add -A` stages it as a broken, submodule-less gitlink
# (no .gitmodules), which would clone as an empty directory for anyone
# else. Clone it separately per the README instead.
# ============================================================
UERANSIM/

